# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005759> (mitochondrial matrix)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:as") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:0198506732") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005759> "The gel-like material, with considerable fine structure, that lies in the matrix space, or lumen, of a mitochondrion. It contains the enzymes of the tricarboxylic acid cycle and, in some organisms, the enzymes concerned with fatty acid oxidation.")
