AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005930> "Note that cilia and eukaryotic flagella are deemed to be equivalent. In diplomonad species, such as Giardia, the axoneme may extend intracellularly up to 5um away from the plane of the plasma membrane.")
