# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007134> (meiotic telophase I)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:mtg_cell_cycle") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007134> "The cell cycle phase which follows anaphase I of meiosis and during which the chromosomes arrive at the poles of the cell and the division of the cytoplasm starts.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007134> "biological_process")
