AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0032991> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/go#goslim_chembl>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0032991> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/go#goslim_euk_cellular_processes_ribbon>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0032991> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/go#goslim_flybase_ribbon>)
