# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0043652> (engulfment of apoptotic cell)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:rk") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:15536015") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0043652> "The removal of the apoptotic cell by phagocytosis, by a neighboring cell or by a phagocyte.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0043652> "engulfment of apoptotic cell corpse")
